      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Stop action disable itself seems to still be working okay for me. Specifically, stop action disable that resets an animator, drives a parameter, and animates with that parameter change.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E_yua0lRL6A\nI think the problem is related to the audio source component(s), because the particle death, stop action disable, and animator reset are working as usual. Something may be causing a problem when the object with audio related components is disabled via stop action, or being kept on with an animation.",
